&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;13. In February, Angelina Galiteva resigned from the ISO Board of Governors and subsequently Alice Reynolds was appointed to join the ISO Board of Governors, pending confirmation by the California Senate.&amp;#160; Also in February, Joe Eto was reappointed by California Governor Gavin Newsom to serve another three-year term on the ISO Board of Governors, pending confirmation by the California Senate. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
